{
  "bodyHash": "cekPTKhMz8s=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海洋生物</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组为你的世界水域增添了数十种独特的鱼类物种，每种鱼都栖息在其自然生物群系中。从深海捕食者到宁静的河流居民，海洋变得生机勃勃、丰富多彩。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">设置捕鱼陷阱来自动捕获鱼类，或使用鱼类孵化场随时间繁殖它们。在钓鱼时发现新的战利品，或烹饪美味的鱼类主题餐点。你的海洋和河流从未如此充满活力。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">捕鱼陷阱：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">放置在水下并放入腐肉作为诱饵，即可在你忙碌时捕鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鱼类孵化场：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">放置在浅水中，通过桶中的鱼随时间繁殖。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新钓鱼战利品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">发现海盗宝藏、空罐头、鱼骨和化石。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🖼️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自定义画作：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用新的水生主题自定义艺术品装饰你的世界。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凤尾鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在较冷海洋中发现的小型咸水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神仙鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生活在丛林河流和沼泽中的亮丽淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安康鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在黑暗寒冷海洋深处发现的深海居民。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鲈鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">河流、平原和森林中常见的淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🩵 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蓝唐王鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在温暖热带海洋中繁茂的彩色礁鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">弓鳍鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">慢速河流和沼泽水域的淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🦋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蝴蝶鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在温暖海洋生物群系中发现的鲜艳礁鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鲤鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生活在河流、平原和森林中的耐寒淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鲶鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">河流和沼泽中的底栖鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圆鳍雅罗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在河流和溪流中发现的小型淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💛 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">豆娘鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在珊瑚礁中穿梭的微小热带鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚡ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">电鳐：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自多种海洋深度的令人震撼的咸水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在河流和池塘中发现的温和淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锦鲤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在河流和樱花林中游泳的观赏性鲤鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🩸 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">七鳃鳗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在淡水和咸水中都能发现的寄生鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">肺鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沼泽和丛林中的呼吸空气的鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪸 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蝠鲼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在温暖至温带水域的优雅海洋巨兽。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">米诺鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在河流和草地上发现的微小鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">霓虹脂鲤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自丛林河流的明亮热带鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白斑狗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自针叶林湖泊和河流的冷水捕食者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">河鲈：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">湖泊、河流和草地中的淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">美洲狗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自河流和森林溪流的淡水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">水虎鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在丛林水域中发现的攻击性捕食者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏜️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鳉鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生活在孤立河流中的小型沙漠鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙丁鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在寒冷深海中的群居咸水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">暹罗斗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自丛林和沼泽的彩色热带鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🩶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">银纹河豚：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自冰冷海洋的冷水河豚。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏖️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白边瞻星鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在温暖海洋中潜沙的热带鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黄貂鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">来自温带和热带海域的沿海鱼类。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鳟鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在针叶林溪流和树林中发现的冷水鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金枪鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在开阔水域巡游的大型海洋捕食者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">北美狗鱼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生活在湖泊和河流中的北方淡水鱼。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端与服务器均需安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（在 Fabric 上需要安装 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 制作）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本上，还需要安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录中，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有模组都存在所有类型，甚至可能没有任何类型。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/joshiejack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">joshiejack</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 制作的原始 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanted-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Piscary</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组，其中包含了丰富多样的新海洋生物和精细的细节，现已延续至现代 Minecraft 版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更新并优化了部分纹理。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vehicle-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/convenient-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armored-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armorstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
